, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">구직자 및 재직자&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">선착순 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">  <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">※ 국민취업지원제도 2유형은 참여 불가</span></span><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">  </span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">※ 초보자도 수강 가능한 맞춤형 강의로 진행</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-ser